  "title": "Ukraine-Russia Aerial Attacks Escalate as Aid Centers Hit with 26 Killed",
  "summary": "Heavy Russian missile and drone attacks in Kyiv have killed at least 26 people in and around Ukraine's aid center, with Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy and emergency services describing the violence as a 'disgraceful' shoot-out. US envoys are trying to revive peace talks while Russia plans a 72-hour strike pause.",
  "facts": [
