      "statement": "Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy reported at least 26 deaths in a Russian strike on a Ukrainian aid center.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Russian and Ukrainian sources confirmed the attacks targeted a school and a nearby shelter in Komyshuvakha, southern Zaporizhzhia.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
